(env-gasmodel "table")(env-gaslimit 10000000)(env-gas 0)
(print "=== TX-11M — deploy live StoicPay team recipient accounts so the 1.5x buy-side split resolves ===")
;; #11M: 04_STOICPAY now matches the deployed module exactly (5 team recipients, 1.5x total = the 40/60
;;       split, 250M end supply). COMPANY + VENTURE1 already exist from genesis; the remaining live
;;       recipients VENTURE2/3/4 are registered here (admin A_DeployStandardAccount, arbitrary key guard)
;;       so the buy-side C_MultiBulkTransfer in [6.1]'s C_BuyStoicPay can credit all five. Zero divergence.
